<title>POLAND: Polish c.bank sells PLN 306 mln of NBP-bills.</title>
<headline>Polish c.bank sells PLN 306 mln of NBP-bills.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland sold 81 million zlotys of 91-day NBP-bills and 225 million zlotys of 273-day bills, the central bank said.</p>
<p>Both papers were sold at flat average yields of 22.00 percent.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 2 653 9700</p>
</text>
